@startuml
title Deployment Plan — Activity Diagram (Current API)
skinparam shadowing false

|IT Helpdesk|
start
:Enter plan name, devices and patches;
|API / Service|
:Validate selected device and patch IDs;
if (All IDs exist?) then (yes)
  :Create DRAFT plan, plan-device links and PENDING tasks;
else (no)
  :Return 404 with missing IDs;
  stop
endif

|IT Helpdesk|
:Edit draft if needed;
note right
  Submitting a draft for approval is not yet implemented.
end note

|Manager|
:Call review API directly;
if (Review decision?) then (changes requested)
  |API / Service|
  :Set CHANGES_REQUESTED and review metadata;
  |IT Helpdesk|
  :Edit plan in CHANGES_REQUESTED state;
  |Manager|
  :Call review API again;
  note right
    This diagram shows one revision cycle.
    The cycle may be repeated.
  end note
endif

if (Final decision?) then (approved)
  |API / Service|
  :Set APPROVED and review metadata;
  |IT Helpdesk|
  :Call deploy API;
  |API / Service|
  if (Plan is APPROVED?) then (yes)
    :Set plan to DEPLOYING and tasks to PENDING;
    note right
      Automated task execution and final status
      updates are not implemented yet.
    end note
  else (no)
    :Return 400;
  endif
else (rejected)
  |API / Service|
  :Set REJECTED and review metadata;
endif
stop
@enduml
